      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Which of the following calls to the &lt;code&gt;add()&lt;/code&gt; function are correct?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;func add(args ...int) int {&#xA;    sum := 0&#xA;    for _, arg := range args {&#xA;        sum &amp;#43;= arg&#xA;    }&#xA;    return sum&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;A. add(1, 2)&#xA;B. add(1, 3, 7)&#xA;C. add([]int{1, 2})&#xA;D. add([]int{1, 3, 7}&amp;hellip;)&#xA;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Reference Answer and Analysis: ABD.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Key takeaway: Variadic functions.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
